From: =?UTF-8?q?Kenan=20Kasumovi=C4=87?=
 <46025606+Ken5998@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 16:59:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(input): the pad's A answers prompts over the drive

Outside the menus A only reached the driving actions, so a new career's
save boxes, message boxes and a tutorial's CONTINUE took only the
keyboard's Enter. A now sets the same accept as Enter there too.
---
 mcla-rs/crates/game/src/main.rs | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/mcla-rs/crates/game/src/main.rs b/mcla-rs/crates/game/src/main.rs
index 02b22ba..737626d 100644
--- a/mcla-rs/crates/game/src/main.rs
+++ b/mcla-rs/crates/game/src/main.rs
@@ -1924,6 +1924,9 @@ impl App {
             self.game.nav_map |= p(6) && self.game.show_map;
             return;
         }
+        // (A answers what stands over the drive as the keyboard's Enter does: a new career's save boxes, a
+        // message box, a tutorial's CONTINUE, a story caption. Without it only Enter got past them.)
+        self.game.nav_enter |= p(0);
         // (the active controller map, `mc4`: the driving buttons are its actions. START and BACK
         // stay what they are - the original's editor cannot give them away.)
         let slots = self.game.mc4_controls(self.hyd_on && self.game.hydraulics);
